---
import ContentCard from '../components/ContentCard.astro';
import HeroHeader from '../components/HeroHeader.astro';
import PageShell from '../layouts/PageShell.astro';
import { heroConfig, profileConfig, siteTitle } from '../config';
import { buildSameAsLinks } from '../lib/profile/social';

const profile = profileConfig;
const aboutHero = heroConfig.about;
const siteURL = Astro.site ?? Astro.url;
const sameAs = buildSameAsLinks(profile);
const profileAvatarSrc = typeof profile.avatar === 'string' ? profile.avatar : profile.avatar?.src;

const personSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Person',
  '@id': new URL('/about/#person', siteURL).toString(),
  name: profile.name,
  description: profile.bio,
  jobTitle: profile.title,
  url: new URL('/about/', siteURL).toString(),
  ...(profileAvatarSrc ? { image: new URL(profileAvatarSrc, siteURL).toString() } : {}),
  ...(profile.location ? { homeLocation: { '@type': 'Place', name: profile.location } } : {}),
  ...(sameAs.length > 0 ? { sameAs } : {}),
};
---

<PageShell
  title={`About | ${siteTitle}`}
  description="關於 Eason 的個人網站（版型預覽）"
  schema={personSchema}
  transparentHeader={true}
  pageId="about"
>
  <HeroHeader
    text={aboutHero.text}
    subtitle={aboutHero.subtitle}
    backgroundImage={aboutHero.backgroundImage}
    compact={true}
  />

  <main class="about-main">
    <ContentCard id="about-preview">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <div class="preview-notice"><span class="notice-dot"></span> ABOUT PAGE PREVIEW <span class="notice-muted">以下內容為版型示範，尚未放入正式個人資料</span></div>

        <section class="intro-panel" aria-labelledby="about-name">
          <div class="portrait-col">
            <div class="portrait-placeholder" aria-label="照片預留位置">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.5"/><path d="M4.5 21c.5-5.2 3.1-8 7.5-8s7 2.8 7.5 8"/></svg>
              <span>PHOTO</span>
            </div>
            <span class="portrait-caption">個人照片可之後再決定</span>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-copy">
            <div class="eyebrow">HELLO, I'M</div>
            <h1 id="about-name">Eason <span class="name-zh">/ 個人介紹</span></h1>
            <p class="headline">Student · Developer · Still learning</p>
            <p class="lead">嗨，我是 Eason。這裡會放一段簡短的自我介紹，說明我目前在做什麼，以及為什麼建立這個網站。文字之後可以慢慢改，不用一次寫完。</p>
            <div class="intro-chips"><span>臺灣</span><span>程式開發</span><span>運動</span><span>寫作</span></div>
            <div class="socials">
              <a href="https://github.com/eason11133" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              <span class="social-placeholder">Email（待設定）</span>
              <span class="social-placeholder">其他連結（待設定）</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="section-grid">
          <section class="content-section story-section" aria-labelledby="story-title">
            <header class="section-heading"><span class="section-index">01</span><div><span class="section-kicker">THE STORY</span><h2 id="story-title">一些關於我的事</h2></div></header>
            <div class="story-content">
              <p>這裡先放示範文字。可以從以前喜歡的事情寫起，接著談到什麼時候開始接觸程式，以及這幾年做過哪些嘗試。</p>
              <p>不一定每件事都要寫成成果，也不需要把這裡變成自傳。之後可以照你自己的語氣，把真正想留下來的故事放進來。</p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="content-section now-section" aria-labelledby="now-title">
            <header class="section-heading"><span class="section-index">02</span><div><span class="section-kicker">CURRENTLY</span><h2 id="now-title">最近在忙什麼</h2></div></header>
            <div class="now-list">
              <div class="now-item"><div class="item-indicator"></div><div><strong>正在做的專案 A</strong><p>這裡放一句簡單介紹，之後可以連到專案詳細頁。</p></div></div>
              <div class="now-item"><div class="item-indicator"></div><div><strong>正在學的技術 B</strong><p>例如最近在學的語言、工具，或遇到的新問題。</p></div></div>
              <div class="now-item"><div class="item-indicator"></div><div><strong>網站與文章</strong><p>記錄一些心得、練習過程，還有生活中的事情。</p></div></div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="content-section interests-section" aria-labelledby="interests-title">
            <header class="section-heading"><span class="section-index">03</span><div><span class="section-kicker">OFF THE KEYBOARD</span><h2 id="interests-title">工作桌以外</h2></div></header>
            <div class="interests-grid">
              <div class="interest-tile"><span class="interest-icon" aria-hidden="true">⚾</span><strong>棒球</strong><small>示範興趣介紹</small></div>
              <div class="interest-tile"><span class="interest-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏀</span><strong>籃球</strong><small>示範興趣介紹</small></div>
              <div class="interest-tile"><span class="interest-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎱</span><strong>撞球</strong><small>示範興趣介紹</small></div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="content-section experience-section" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
            <header class="section-heading"><span class="section-index">04</span><div><span class="section-kicker">A FEW MILESTONES</span><h2 id="experience-title">經歷簡表</h2></div></header>
            <div class="timeline">
              <div class="timeline-item"><span class="timeline-date">20XX</span><div><strong>示範經歷一</strong><p>留下一行描述即可，詳細內容放作品與經歷頁。</p></div></div>
              <div class="timeline-item"><span class="timeline-date">20XX</span><div><strong>示範經歷二</strong><p>之後可以換成自己的比賽、專案或其他經驗。</p></div></div>
              <div class="timeline-item"><span class="timeline-date">20XX</span><div><strong>示範經歷三</strong><p>這裡只是展示時間軸排版，不代表真實經歷。</p></div></div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
        <footer class="about-footer"><span>Still writing my story.</span><span>最後更新：示範內容</span></footer>
      </div>
    </ContentCard>
  </main>

  <style>
    .about-main { position:relative; margin-top:-88px; padding-bottom: 96px; background:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 88px,var(--color-bg) 88px); }
    .about-inner { max-width: 1090px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 32px 64px; color:var(--color-text); }
    .preview-notice { display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.12em; font-weight:700; color:var(--accent); padding:12px 0 28px; }
    .notice-dot { width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent); }
    .notice-muted { letter-spacing:0; font-weight:400;color:var(--color-text-muted); font-size:12px; }
    .intro-panel { display:grid; grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr); gap:38px; padding:38px; border:1px solid var(--color-border); background:var(--color-surface); border-radius:18px; box-shadow:var(--shadow-card); }
    .portrait-col {display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
    .portrait-placeholder {width:196px;height:220px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--color-surface-elevated),var(--color-bg));border:1px dashed var(--color-border);color:var(--color-text-muted);}
    .portrait-placeholder svg {width:82px;height:82px;opacity:.65}
    .portrait-placeholder span {font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.24em;}
    .portrait-caption {font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-muted);text-align:center;}
    .intro-copy {min-width:0;}
    .eyebrow,.section-kicker {font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;}
    .intro-copy h1 {font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,47px);font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;margin:12px 0 7px;color:var(--color-text-strong);}
    .name-zh {font-size:.46em;font-weight:500;color:var(--color-text-muted);}
    .headline {color:var(--accent);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 22px;}
    .lead {line-height:1.9;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin:0 0 22px;max-width:65ch;}
    .intro-chips,.socials {display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;}
    .intro-chips span {font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:100px;color:var(--color-text-secondary);background:var(--color-surface-elevated);}
    .socials {margin-top:24px;}
    .socials a,.social-placeholder {font-size:13px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:9px;color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:none;background:var(--color-bg);}
    .socials a:hover {border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);}
    .social-placeholder {opacity:.6;}
    .section-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;margin-top:26px;}
    .content-section {min-width:0;padding:30px 32px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);background:var(--color-surface);}
    .section-heading {display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;margin-bottom:25px;}
    .section-index {font-size:13px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--accent);font-weight:750;padding-top:4px;}
    .section-heading h2 {font-size:21px;line-height:1.3;margin:6px 0 0;color:var(--color-text-strong);}
    .story-section,.experience-section {grid-column:span 1;}
    .story-content p {color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-size:14px;line-height:2;margin:0 0 15px;}
    .story-content p:last-child {margin-bottom:0;}
    .now-list {display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
    .now-item {display:flex;gap:14px;padding:0 0 19px;}
    .now-item:not(:first-child){padding-top:19px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);}
    .now-item:last-child {padding-bottom:0;}
    .item-indicator {flex:none;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);margin-top:8px;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(var(--accent-rgb),.08);}
    .now-item strong,.timeline-item strong {font-size:14px;color:var(--color-text-strong);}
    .now-item p,.timeline-item p {color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin:6px 0 0;}
    .interests-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;}
    .interest-tile {min-width:0;padding:18px 9px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-align:center;background:var(--color-surface-elevated);border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);}
    .interest-icon {font-size:26px;}
    .interest-tile strong {font-size:14px;color:var(--color-text-strong);}
    .interest-tile small {font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-muted);}
    .timeline {border-left:1px solid var(--color-border);margin-left:6px;padding-left:22px;}
    .timeline-item {position:relative;padding:0 0 24px;}
    .timeline-item:last-child {padding-bottom:0;}
    .timeline-item:before {content:"";position:absolute;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);border:3px solid var(--color-surface);left:-27px;top:4px;}
    .timeline-date {display:inline-block;margin:0 0 7px;color:var(--accent);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;}
    .about-footer {display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:12px;margin:28px 2px 0;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);}
    @media(max-width:850px){.intro-panel{grid-template-columns:180px minmax(0,1fr);gap:22px;padding:25px}.portrait-placeholder{width:165px;height:194px}.section-grid{gap:14px}.content-section{padding:23px 22px}}
    @media(max-width:720px){.about-main{margin-top:-56px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 56px,var(--color-bg) 56px);padding-bottom:50px}.about-inner{padding:12px 0 32px}.preview-notice{padding:16px 20px 20px}.intro-panel{border-radius:0;grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:26px 22px;gap:20px}.portrait-placeholder{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%}.portrait-placeholder svg{width:55px;height:55px}.portrait-col{gap:8px}.intro-copy h1{font-size:32px}.section-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px;margin:14px 0}.content-section{border-radius:0;padding:25px 22px}.about-footer{padding:18px 22px 0;margin-top:16px}.section-heading{margin-bottom:17px}.interests-grid{gap:7px}.interest-tile{padding:14px 4px}.interest-tile small{font-size:10px}}
    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{transition:none!important}}
  </style>
</PageShell>
